      "category": "Text",
      "text": "TO: HEADS OF ALL DEPARTMENTS AND AGENCIES\n\nFROM: ROBERT W. SWEET, DEPUTY MAYOR\n\nSUBJECT: 1970 LEGISLATIVE PROGRAM",
